url: "https://pedroluizskt.github.io/bioinformatica-vegetal-sdm/"
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - species distribution modeling
  - ecological niche modeling
  - plant genomics
  - DNA barcoding
  - phylogenetics
  - Brazilian flora
  - reproducible research
